2.
Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
a. "Act" means the Andhra Pradesh Fiscal Responsibility and Budget Management Act, 2005;
b. "form" means a form appended to these rules;
c. "section" means a section of the Act;
d. words and expressions used herein but not defined and defined in the Act shall have the meanings respectively
assigned to them in the Act.
